OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks thrown at fire crews
OL,4,Aresponding to incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks were deliberately directed at
OL,7,Ffire crews during six separate
OL,8,Fincidents on Halloween night as they
OL,9,Fresponded to dozens of callouts across
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FThe fire service responded to 89
OL,13,Fincidents, several of which were
OL,14,FHalloween-related with 23 of them
OL,15,Finvolving bonfires, between 18:00 GMT
OL,16,Fon Saturday and 01:00 on Sunday.
OL,18,F"No damage or injuries resulted and
OL,19,Foperational response for local
OL,20,Fcommunities was maintained throughout,"
OL,21,Fa Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,22,FService (NIFRS) spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
