OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks thrown at fire crews
OL,4,Aresponding to incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween celebrations took place
OL,7,Facross Northern Ireland over the
OL,8,Fweekend, with the biggest festival
OL,9,Fbeing held in Londonderry on Saturday
OL,10,Fevening.
